  "subject": "a clumsy office clerk who buys his first tiny juniper bonsai at the Mong Kok Flower Market, names it Ah Keung, and reports his day to it every evening while trying not to kill it",
  "caption": "Cantonese Motown soul in the 1960s Detroit style. Driving four-on-the-floor drums with shaken tambourine on every beat; melodic busy electric bass lines; bright vibraphone accents; punchy trumpet and saxophone horn section stabs. Bright vintage mono-leaning mix, warm room reverb. Male baritone lead with female backing call-and-response. 122 BPM, C major. Sunny, comic and upbeat. No trap drums, no autotune, no EDM synths, no modern pop compression.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n花墟街口六十蚊\n一棵細細嘅真柏\n老闆話佢唔易養\n我話我會好好錫\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n返到屋企擺喺窗台\n叫佢做阿強\n\n[Chorus]\n早晨呀阿強\n今日我又遲到\n你飲咗水未呀\n我淋你啱啱好\n\n[Verse]\n上網睇咗兩粒鐘\n話剪枝要有耐性\n我拎住把細鉸剪\n手震到剪唔落\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n阿強唔出聲\n不過葉都企直咗\n\n[Chorus]\n晚安呀阿強\n今日老細讚我\n你冇乜嘢講\n我當你都開心\n\n[Verse]\n有一日佢黃咗兩枝\n我即刻打去花墟\n老闆笑我淋太多水\n叫我唔好咁緊張\n\n[Bridge]\n原來錫一樣嘢\n都要識得放手\n\n[Chorus]\n早晨呀阿強\n今日我冇遲到\n你出咗粒新芽\n我影咗廿張相\n\n[Chorus]\n早晨呀阿強\n今日我冇遲到\n你出咗粒新芽\n我影咗廿張相\n\n[Outro]\n阿強 阿強\n聽日見",
